---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const pillars = [
  {
    n: '01',
    href: '/free-eva/',
    title: 'Free Eva',
    zh: '釋放謝翌',
    body: 'Eva Xie is a Princeton PhD student. She went to an academic conference and was detained by ICE on her way home. She belongs back in her lab and her classroom, now.',
    cta: 'Her story and how to help',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    href: '/mutual-respect/',
    title: 'Mutual Respect',
    zh: '相互尊重',
    body: 'We support lawful immigration enforcement. We ask that it be done with judgment, and that foreign guests here be treated the way we want Americans treated abroad.',
    cta: 'What better enforcement looks like',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    href: '/us-china/',
    title: 'US–China',
    zh: '中美友誼',
    body: 'Two hundred and forty years of trade, study, science and friendship, with hard chapters too. Competition does not have to crowd out collaboration.',
    cta: 'The shared history and what we can do',
  },
];
---
<Base>
  <section class="page-hero home-hero">
    <div class="wrap home-hero-wrap">
      <img class="hero-mark" src="/img/logo-mark.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="420" height="420" />
      <p class="zh-title" lang="zh-Hant">釋放謝翌 · {site.respectZh}</p>
      <h1>FREE EVA</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A student is not a threat. Eva Xie, a PhD student at Princeton, was detained by ICE when she came home
        from a conference. We are asking for her release, for enforcement that respects the people it touches,
        and for a relationship between the United States and China built on mutual respect.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/free-eva/#act">Help free Eva</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/mutual-respect/">Read our position</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/shop/">Get the shirt</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Three things we stand for</p>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        {pillars.map((p) => (
          <a class="card accent pillar" href={p.href}>
            <span class="pillar-n">{p.n}</span>
            <h3>{p.title} <span class="zh orange pillar-zh" lang="zh-Hant">{p.zh}</span></h3>
            <p class="muted">{p.body}</p>
            <p class="pillar-cta">{p.cta} →</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where we stand</p>
      <h2>Firm, lawful, respectful.</h2>
      <p>
        This campaign is not against the people who enforce our immigration laws. It is for doing that job well.
        We think detaining a graduate student who left to present her research, and came back to continue it,
        is the wrong call. We think the way it was handled falls short of the respect any guest of this country
        is owed. And we think the answer is the same rule Americans hope for when they travel: treat others the
        way you want to be treated.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        Mutual respect is the basis for collaboration. <span class="zh orange" lang="zh-Hant">{site.respectZh}</span>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .home-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 13vw, 8.5rem); margin-bottom: 0.2em; }
  .pillar { text-decoration: none; color: var(--white); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s; }
  .pillar:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--white); }
  .pillar-n { font-family: var(--font-stencil); color: var(--orange); font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .pillar-zh { font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 0.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .pillar-cta { margin-top: auto; color: var(--orange-soft); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
